{"id":"n21116-1-7","stage":4,"title":"분주하다 · 繁忙","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21116-1-7-1","ko":"어딜 그렇게 분주하게 뛰어가니?","zh":"你跑得那么急匆匆的，要去哪儿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어딜","meaning":"怎么，哪里，哪能","explanation":"어디：怎么，哪里，哪能；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60320","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분주하게","meaning":"繁忙，忙碌","explanation":"분주하다：繁忙，忙碌；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"분주하다","audio":"/audio/7a023724ce468c543e21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21116","senseId":"1","lemma":"분주하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰어가니?","meaning":"跑去，跑到，奔去","explanation":"뛰어가다：跑去，跑到，奔去；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어가다","audio":"/audio/4a166b1354edef73bafd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14439","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"怎么，哪里，哪能","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60320","definition":"用于反问的语气，意在强调。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"7a023724ce468c54","term":"분주하다","zh":"繁忙，忙碌","audio":"/audio/7a023724ce468c543e21.mp3","entryId":"21116","definition":"忙得焦头烂额。","pronunciation":["분주하다"]},{"id":"4a166b1354edef73","term":"뛰어가다","zh":"跑去，跑到，奔去","audio":"/audio/4a166b1354edef73bafd.mp3","entryId":"14439","definition":"向着某个地方快速跑过去。","pronunciation":["뛰어가다","뛰여가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/84a62163c69e85e3febf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21116-1-7-2","ko":"급한 일이 생겨서 빨리 가 봐야 하거든요.","zh":"因为出了点急事，我得赶紧过去呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"급한","meaning":"急","explanation":"급하다：急；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"1","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겨서","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐야","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하거든요.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"处境或情况处于需要赶紧处理的状态。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2f65ee82fb9a39999ca4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.075,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=21116","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.9017,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为出了点急事，我得赶紧过去呢。","你跑得那么急匆匆的，要去哪儿啊？","今天这肉真的特别好吃吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你跑得那么急匆匆的，要去哪儿啊？","今天这肉真的特别好吃吧？","因为出了点急事，我得赶紧过去呢。"],"answer":2}]}
